+  // away in `lift`: only while the player is within `notice` m. Under it as it lands: `damage`, `keep` of the
+  // speed, and stunned; run into while it lies there (hl m of road each way): softDamage, and softKeep; and it only crawls (crawl m/s) until it is out from under
